<h2>1. What Are Cookies & Local Storage?</h2>
<p>Cookies and local storage objects are tiny data files stored in your web browser memory to preserve essential state parameters between page navigation requests.</p>

<h2>2. Our Strict Essential-Only Policy</h2>
<p>Unlike commercial websites that track user habits across the web, <strong>aimadulislam.dpdns.org</strong> employs zero persistent ad tracking cookies, zero analytics beacons, and zero marketing pixels.</p>

